# P7 polish 2: every section tile of a plugin engine's patch editor grid has an icon and a label on the Mini (SynthPatchEditor.cpp: the
# sections the stock chain misses take the MK66 rule of synth-open/open_section_icon.h). The card holds pluck.plg and alco.plg (plus_flows.sh
# stages the logos card). Synth 1 steps to ALCO as in mini_only_logos.flow, F8 opens the patch editor on its section grid. plus_flows.sh reads
# the tiles afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_SYNTHGRID, the synthgrid line): ten tiles, Combine and Sub among them, none without a label or an icon.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Plugin engine section grid on the Mini (P7 polish 2)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1500ms
expect text "Synth 1"
tap Down x5
wait 1500ms
expect text "ALCO"
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
shot grid-editor
